                                "sense_id": "2e5b2cb2-456b-3500-8954-26321c8d4bea",
                                "text": "... But never a soul had the mense to come near them,[…]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "a1fe8a6e-10f6-4537-8e62-5adab402a11d",
                                "sense_id": "2e5b2cb2-456b-3500-8954-26321c8d4bea",
                                "text": "Little mense to the cheeks to bite aff the nose[…]"
