                                "sense_id": "2e5b2cb2-456b-3500-8954-26321c8d4bea",
                                "text": "For she had baked a crumpie cake And butter scones, for mense's sake, To entertain her lodger."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "8c665644-24e0-46cd-8a10-cbdeaafd3c24",
                                "sense_id": "2e5b2cb2-456b-3500-8954-26321c8d4bea",
                                "text": "Be seen with men of mense, but turn aside From swicks and sweeps, the silly and the low […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "69b6d5b0-88d8-412e-ab3e-49d1fb8f8fdd",
                                "sense_id": "2e5b2cb2-456b-3500-8954-26321c8d4bea",
                                "text": "... ye'll hae the sense and the mense to keep a calm sough,[…]"
                            }
